  "interpretation": [
    "Selected, disjoint media cohorts; not a random sample or a claim about the whole library.",
    "A and B use different media and different APKs; this is not a paired before/after comparison.",
    "100/150/200 ms thresholds are descriptive only, not perceived-zero-delay acceptance criteria.",
    "lastUpRecoveryMs measures recovery after the final UP, not average latency of every tap.",
    "longestUnchangedMs measures unchanged observed pictures during the burst; content can affect it.",
    "Picture recovery uses a same-surface isolated reference, not independent native frame PTS.",
    "All aggregate denominators retain failed and unmeasured runs; metric summaries use passed runs only.",
    "Exact 1080p60 uses either orientation and 59.5-60.5 fps; unknown fps is never assumed to be 60.",
    "Native hardware-preferred configuration does not prove hardware execution; native fallback is possible.",
    "APK SHA256 verifies supplied local artifacts against recorded tested digests, not installed-device identity."
